## The Root Cause of Most Issues

Almost every problem in this audit traces back to **one thing**: the agents compose profile is not running.

Starting it will fix:
- Agents page populating
- Celery workers processing tasks
- Specialist agents registering heartbeats
- Crew Orchestrator becoming reachable
- Healer agent activating
- Error rate dropping from ~45% toward zero
- Grafana getting data from node-exporter, cadvisor, promtail, Loki, Tempo

**Single command to try first:**

```bash
docker compose --profile agents up -d
```

Then wait 60 seconds and hard refresh the Agents page.

